WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.200
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.803
And finally, New Rule,
this dangerous idea

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.940
that has taken root in America,
that something is true

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:09.509
merely because you want
to believe it's true,

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.210
has gotta go.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:16.982
-I... (CHUCKLES)
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:17.116 --> 00:00:18.851
I have spent
an awful lot of time

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:20.553
on this show in the pre-Trump,

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:23.122
and they--
then the Trump presidency years

00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:25.691
trying to convince people
that this man

00:00:25.991 --> 00:00:28.227
would never concede
losing an election,

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.229
no matter what the truth was.

00:00:30.429 --> 00:00:32.498
And what made me so sure of that
was that America

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:35.635
had become a place
where truth no longer mattered.

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:38.838
It was all about whether
it felt right in your gut.

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:42.508
"Donald Trump lost to Joe Biden?
That can't be right."

00:00:43.108 --> 00:00:45.879
(SCOFFS) That's what many
of his fans said and still do.

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:48.381
Any time an issue
didn't go their way,

00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:51.050
the response would be...
(SCOFFS) "...crisis actors.

00:00:51.183 --> 00:00:53.253
That's what that was,
fucking crisis actors."

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:54.787
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:58.124
"False flag operations,
the deep state."

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:01.927
When the Right does this,
we call it conspiracy theories,

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:03.029
and rightly so.

00:01:03.362 --> 00:01:06.399
When the Left does it,
we call it emotional truth.

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:12.005
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:01:14.506 --> 00:01:16.609
Which brings me to Hasan Minhaj,

00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:19.044
the comedian
who answers the question,

00:01:19.178 --> 00:01:21.213
"What if Jussie Smollett
did stand-up?"

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:26.586
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:31.323
If you missed it,
The New Yorker recently ran

00:01:31.457 --> 00:01:34.594
a comprehensive exposé
about how many of the stories

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:37.563
Mr. Minhaj tells
in his act to elicit sympathy

00:01:37.696 --> 00:01:40.466
for himself as a Muslim
and a person of color

00:01:40.799 --> 00:01:42.301
are completely made up.

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:44.437
Now, let's pause here
to acknowledge

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:47.206
that Muslims and people of color
in America have,

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:50.443
of course, faced prejudice
and discrimination.

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:52.511
And this country
has a racial history

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:54.981
that is nothing short
of despicable.

00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:57.317
And some of it
continues to this day.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:59.952
The question
I'm always asking is,

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:02.655
"Where exactly are we
with this now?"

00:02:03.155 --> 00:02:05.657
Because it's not as good
as the Right says it is.

00:02:05.791 --> 00:02:08.261
And I think it's also not as bad
as the Left says.

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:10.863
But if you have
to fabricate the stories

00:02:10.996 --> 00:02:14.367
of your mistreatment,
isn't that itself a comment

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:19.973
-on where we are now?
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:26.846
One of Mr. Minhaj's stories
is about a White girl

00:02:26.979 --> 00:02:30.316
he asked to the prom
who spurned him on the big day

00:02:30.449 --> 00:02:32.518
when her parents
didn't want pictures taken

00:02:32.651 --> 00:02:35.688
with a Brown boy,
except it never happened.

00:02:36.555 --> 00:02:38.958
Then there was the time
the FBI hunted him down

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:40.726
as a suspected terrorist
and threw him

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:43.295
against the hood of a car,
except for the part

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:45.198
where they didn't do that
at all.

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:48.600
 The New Yorker writer
who interviewed Minhaj asks,

00:02:48.734 --> 00:02:50.569
"Does it matter
that neither of those things

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:51.671
really happened?"

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.742
-Yes...
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:56.842 --> 00:02:58.911
-...Yes, it does matter.
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:00.079
It does matter.

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:07.453
If... If you wanna speak truth
to power,

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:09.822
I'm gonna go out on a limb here
and say you have to include

00:03:09.955 --> 00:03:13.893
-the truth part.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:03:14.627 --> 00:03:15.495
(CHUCKLES)

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:20.266
Because he's done this
before with me...

00:03:20.399 --> 00:03:23.002
(CLEARS THROAT) ...accusing me
of saying Muslims should be put

00:03:23.135 --> 00:03:24.304
in internment camps,

00:03:24.437 --> 00:03:27.774
something I've never come close
to thinking, let alone saying.

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:30.643
And it's an odd thing to claim,
given that this show is,

00:03:30.776 --> 00:03:32.779
you know, recorded
with cameras and audio.

00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:34.814
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:03:34.948 --> 00:03:38.751
So, I ask you, a guy saying,
he saw me saying,

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:41.787
"Round up the Muslims" on TV,
even though I never did,

00:03:41.921 --> 00:03:43.889
how is that different
than this guy?

00:03:44.657 --> 00:03:47.460
And I watched in Jersey City,
New Jersey,

00:03:47.794 --> 00:03:52.231
where thousands and thousands
of people were cheering

00:03:52.531 --> 00:03:55.167
as that building
was coming down.

00:03:55.501 --> 00:03:56.736
-(SCOFFS)
-(AUDIENCE MEMBER CHUCKLES)

00:03:56.869 --> 00:03:59.271
This country needs
to make a grand bargain.

00:03:59.405 --> 00:04:01.840
Bullshit is bad,
no matter who says it,

00:04:01.974 --> 00:04:06.613
-or what you call it.
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING, CHEERING)

00:04:16.188 --> 00:04:17.122
Minhaj says,

00:04:17.456 --> 00:04:21.327
"The emotional truth is first,
the factual truth is secondary."

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:23.963
That's the part of the zeitgeist
he has captured.

00:04:24.097 --> 00:04:26.065
That it's all about getting
to the truth man,

00:04:26.198 --> 00:04:28.534
and what better way to do that
than by lying.

00:04:28.667 --> 00:04:30.736
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:04:30.869 --> 00:04:33.539
I think the younger generations
have a real problem

00:04:33.672 --> 00:04:35.474
with wanting
to build their identity

00:04:35.607 --> 00:04:37.076
around being a victim.

00:04:37.276 --> 00:04:41.047
They wanna have racism to fight,
not fight racism,

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:45.384
have racism to fight so badly
that when it's not there,

00:04:45.518 --> 00:04:46.452
they make it up.

00:04:46.886 --> 00:04:48.854
And there's enough real racism
in the world

00:04:48.987 --> 00:04:50.690
that making up more
doesn't help.

00:04:50.823 --> 00:04:54.460
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING, CHEERING)
-(CLEARS THROAT)

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:02.801
Minhaj told The New Yorker
that his actual life

00:05:02.935 --> 00:05:05.438
was too dull to provide
juicy material

00:05:05.571 --> 00:05:07.673
-for his acts.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:05:07.807 --> 00:05:10.509
-Isn't that a good thing?
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:05:10.643 --> 00:05:13.746
He seems to literally feel
cheated by progress.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:16.349
-The pro--
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:05:16.482 --> 00:05:19.418
The progress that has denied him
any good stories

00:05:19.551 --> 00:05:21.554
about being oppressed
by the man.

00:05:21.687 --> 00:05:24.090
Dude, America is far
from the worst.

00:05:24.223 --> 00:05:26.359
You're a Muslim
married to a Hindu.

00:05:26.492 --> 00:05:28.994
If you were living in India,
she'd have to murder you.

00:05:29.128 --> 00:05:31.664
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:05:31.797 --> 00:05:32.799
(BILL MAHER CLEARING THROAT)

00:05:37.904 --> 00:05:40.840
And that prom date
that he talks about,

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:43.809
he didn't disguise
her identity very well,

00:05:43.976 --> 00:05:47.880
and now, she has had to deal
with death threats and doxing.

00:05:48.014 --> 00:05:51.750
There are consequences to lying
and funny side story,

00:05:51.884 --> 00:05:54.287
you know who she married?
Another Indian guy.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.789
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:05:56.922 --> 00:05:59.191
Hearing that,
even Minhaj himself must know,

00:05:59.325 --> 00:06:01.026
"Man,
if people don't like you now,

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:03.829
it's probably not because
you're a person of color,

00:06:03.962 --> 00:06:05.531
it's because you're shady."

